        {
            "text": "VIDEO\n\nThe Value of an Enterprise Data Cloud (EDC)\n\nDiscover how Everpure's Enterprise Data Cloud unifies hybrid environments, puts data under intelligent software control, strengthens cyber resilience, and delivers always-available data so your organization can accelerate insights, simplify operations, and maximize value.",
            "href": "https://go.theregister.com/k/the-value-of-an-enterprise-data-cloud-edc"
        },
        {
            "text": "SOLUTIONS BRIEF\n\n4 Reasons to Choose an Enterprise Data Cloud\n\nHow the Everpure Platform can help you shift from managing infrastructure to delivering business outcomes.",
            "href": "https://go.theregister.com/k/4-reasons-to-choose-an-enterprise-data-cloud"
        },
        {
            "text": "WHITEPAPER\n\nYour AI is Only As Good as Your Data Platform\n\nDiscover why AI success depends on a unified data platform. Learn how Everpure Enterprise Data Cloud cuts risk, copies, and complexity to keep AI moving.",
            "href": "https://go.theregister.com/k/your-ai-is-only-as-good-as-your-data-platform"
        },
        {
            "text": "WHITEPAPER\n\nWhat Legacy Systems Really Cost You\n\nLearn how legacy storage providers commonly use deep discounts and \"free\" offers to mask outdated architectures, hidden costs, and a lack of innovation.",
            "href": "https://go.theregister.com/k/what-legacy-systems-really-cost-you"
        },
        {
            "text": "EBOOK\n\nTop 5 Reasons to Consider Pure Storage Platform\n\nDiscover 5 reasons to consider the Everpure platform for your AI infrastructure needs.",
            "href": "https://go.theregister.com/k/top-5-reasons-to-consider-pure-storage-platform"
        },
        {
            "text": "EBOOK\n\nA New Standard for Enterprise Data Storage\n\nEverpure powers the enterprise data cloud with zero downtime, efficiency, flexible buying, strong SLAs, and built-in cyber resilience.",
            "href": "https://go.theregister.com/k/a-new-standard-for-enterprise-data-storage"
        },
        {
            "text": "BLOG\n\nDo You Have a Platform or a Portfolio? A Litmus Test for IT Leaders\n\nWhen it comes to data storage environments, many organizations have a complex portfolio of solutions rather than a single platform that reduces complexity and cost and provides a foundation for AI and the Enterprise Data Cloud.",
            "href": "https://go.theregister.com/k/do-you-have-a-platform-or-a-portfolio"
        },
