    "text_full": "Sign in\n\nThe Register Home Page\n\nSearch\nNavigation\n\nSponsored By\n\nManage your data, not your storage\n\nRun all your data on a modern platform built for AI. Replace isolated storage silos with a simple, unified data platform that delivers consistent performance and built-in resilience.\n\nVIDEO\n\nThe Value of an Enterprise Data Cloud (EDC)\n\nDiscover how Everpure's Enterprise Data Cloud unifies hybrid environments, puts data under intelligent software control, strengthens cyber resilience, and delivers always-available data so your organization can accelerate insights, simplify operations, and maximize value.\n\nSOLUTIONS BRIEF\n\n4 Reasons to Choose an Enterprise Data Cloud\n\nHow the Everpure Platform can help you shift from managing infrastructure to delivering business outcomes.\n\nWHITEPAPER\n\nYour AI is Only As Good as Your Data Platform\n\nDiscover why AI success depends on a unified data platform. Learn how Everpure Enterprise Data Cloud cuts risk, copies, and complexity to keep AI moving.\n\nWHITEPAPER\n\nWhat Legacy Systems Really Cost You\n\nLearn how legacy storage providers commonly use deep discounts and \"free\" offers to mask outdated architectures, hidden costs, and a lack of innovation.\n\nEBOOK\n\nTop 5 Reasons to Consider Pure Storage Platform\n\nDiscover 5 reasons to consider the Everpure platform for your AI infrastructure needs.\n\nEBOOK\n\nA New Standard for Enterprise Data Storage\n\nEverpure powers the enterprise data cloud with zero downtime, efficiency, flexible buying, strong SLAs, and built-in cyber resilience.\n\nBLOG\n\nDo You Have a Platform or a Portfolio? A Litmus Test for IT Leaders\n\nWhen it comes to data storage environments, many organizations have a complex portfolio of solutions rather than a single platform that reduces complexity and cost and provides a foundation for AI and the Enterprise Data Cloud.\n\nBACK TO TOP\nThe Register Home Page\n\nBiting the hand that feeds IT\n\nABOUT US\nContact 